WEBVTT

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.940
<b>Her Relationship With Lupin</b>

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.460
Run... A-my...

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.610
Lupin!

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:41.590
Lupin!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.700
Ugo! Are you all right?

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:49.710
Yes... He knocked me over, that's all.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.710
Thank goodness.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.430
Dolma! We came here to save you!

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.200
Why do this?!

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.240
Thank you.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:02.340
But I'm afraid it's too late.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:04.910
Princess!

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:05.750
Are you all right?

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.520
Are you people foreigners?

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:08.860
Don't even think about resisting!

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.370
A-Amy... g-get outta here...

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:14.980
I'm not going anywhere without you.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.850
Hello, Underworld.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.300
The internet's down?

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.030
What the hell...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.500
Don't fire! You might hit the princess!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:33.740
Fujiko?

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.500
Let's get out of here.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.700
It's too dangerous here. 
You should go back to your room.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.520
My necklace has disappeared...

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.520
Fujiko?

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.520
What do we do now?

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.010
Let's start by crashing over there.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.190
Find the king!

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:11.530
And both Shake Hands bosses!
 Don't let them escape!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.960
You say you can't find them?

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.540
No, sir. The king and the two Shake Hands 
executives are nowhere to be found.

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:27.790
The king <i>must</i> abdicate or the coronation 
won't be considered legitimate.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:32.550
This is bad. If they make it out of the 
country, it could cause real problems.

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.700
If you let anxiety overwhelm you,

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.580
you'll lose battles that should 
have been simple to win.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.070
We shall declare martial law.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.060
After all, we <i>do</i> control the armed forces.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.520
All we need to do is ensure they don't escape.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.840
What are those sirens?

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.160
They've declared martial law.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.100
It means anyone wandering 
around outside is an enemy.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:58.700
Which is why...

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.960
You on the bike! Hold it right there!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:02.550
Hold on tight!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.230
After them!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.620
Wow...

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:19.900
What the hell is going on in this city?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.000
And Lupin has not returned yet...

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.480
You two! What are you doing out here?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:27.990
Can't you hear the sirens? 
Return to your homes!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.500
What do you reckon?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.110
We should be discreet.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:32.500
Wait!

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:38.250
Stand aside and I won't take your life.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.250
Don't mess with us!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.080
Goemon!

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.620
Freeze!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.620
Bulletproof? In that case...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.300
When did he...

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.780
I avoid needless bloodshed.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:59.690
I see. So the Bloody Teardrop 
has disappeared...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.310
In all likelihood, Lupin's gang 
stole it as they were fleeing.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.700
I already have men out searching for them.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.110
Then, might I inquire why <i>you're</i> still here?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.320
I-I shall join the search immediately!

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:13.340
Wait!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.650
A friend of mine is in Lupin's group.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.340
She must not come to any harm.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.230
Of course.

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.310
Be sure to treat her hospitably.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.050
Yes, sir!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:33.470
And... you <i>will</i> keep your promise 
to spare the king's life, won't you?

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.470
With the gods of Padar as my witnesses.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:50.040
Ugo... This battle will be a difficult one.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.810
I'm fully prepared for that.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.180
Answer me this...

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.000
Why did you help me?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.130
What are you talking about?

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.760
Your original orders were to kill me.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.300
Instead, you've chosen to slip away with me.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.390
My homeland was a small one.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.430
Its only remarkable feature
was its beautiful sea view.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:20.470
We were locked in a state 
of constant civil war,

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.900
waged for the convenience of other nations.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.020
People who should've been countrymen 
hated each other. Killed each other.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:31.780
When I see Padar, I can't help 
but remember my own home.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.780
So you would ask me to become queen?

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:38.600
Even if you're a puppet, 
civil war will be avoided.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.780
It's better than the worst-case scenario.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.890
What was your name in your homeland?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:44.960
Ugo.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.590
Well, Ugo...

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.690
I will accept your proposal.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:52.060
But I do not intend to sell my soul.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:55.800
One day, I will take Padar back from them.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.930
Why would you tell me that?

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.230
The battle will be long,

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.960
but currently, I do not have 
a single retainer to serve me.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:10.310
So you shall be the first to stand at my side.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.130
I'm a CIA agent.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.820
My struggle against America 
will be a protracted one...

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:24.830
And if I cannot persuade you 
to my side, I won't get very far.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:33.860
In my heart, I serve you.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.970
I'm depending on you, my first ally.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:46.120
Get some water boiling. And see 
if you can find any clean utensils.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:54.750
Thank goodness. It's still running.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.240
R-Run...

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.750
You don't have to tell me. 
We're already on the run.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.040
Go on without me...

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.420
I'll get by, somehow.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.500
Oh, will you?

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.500
Shut up and save your strength!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:11.930
The water.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:12.960
Put it down here.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.140
Can you do this?

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.760
Do I have a choice?

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:19.880
Hold him down.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.950
Hold Lupin down! Quickly!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.770
Stop him from moving!

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.290
Here we go.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:39.540
Hold still, Lupin! It'll be over soon!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:58.570
Well, at least it didn't hit any of his organs.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.140
Cold... So c-cold...

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.430
I got it, Lupin!

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:52.710
Attagirl, Fujicakes!

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.960
Y'know, you can go ahead and 
keep that ring, if you want.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.440
I do hope that's not your way of proposing.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.390
Aw, you're no fun.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.700
Fujiko!

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.200
Are you stupid or something?

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.230
Well, I couldn't let you die alone, could I?

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:26.030
Guess not. If this really is the end,

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.310
maybe I should find a nice guy 
to settle down with...

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.230
I wonder who I'll pick...

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:34.230
Aw, don't be like that. Besides, 
I'm the only one up here with you.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:38.240
Well... looks like I don't 
have a choice, then, do I?

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.020
Hurry up and close the door.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.270
Why did you break up?

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:09.720
You really shouldn't pry 
into adult affairs, girl.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:14.530
Lupin's an intense man, 
always smiling or fuming...

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.030
But he never looks sad.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:21.350
Except when he talks about you, Fujiko.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.470
Hello? I've got information 
about the fugitives.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.650
Yes, the address is...

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:38.160
Dammit, Lupin, phone us already.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:41.160
It's Lupin. He will get by, somehow.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.520
I guess you're right, but even so...

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.020
We have been in situations like this before.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.840
But Lupin has always managed 
to overcome all obstacles.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:52.460
With or without our help.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.690
C'mon, Goemon...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:58.180
At times, I wonder whether 
he has ever truly needed our aid.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.460
I know Lupin's around here somewhere.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.910
Nobody else would have 
the gall to impersonate me.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.460
By analyzing the chatter 
on social networks,

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.470
we can deduce what's 
going on in the capital.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.770
Before it even happens.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:28.140
And because of that, we were able to 
make our move before the coup began.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:33.300
We've won the information 
war, Your Highness.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:38.340
Just what <i>is</i> this "PeopleLog"
 app you've created?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:41.750
I thought it was just a 
more sophisticated SNS...

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.250
It's a torch.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:48.240
And with it, we will illuminate 
every dark corner of the world.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.020
I like the sound of that!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.260
They say fire is what allowed 
man to evolve from apes.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:58.050
What's going to happen when 
there's no darkness left, Enzo?

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:01.090
Half the countries in 
the world will disappear.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.600
He's sleeping a lot.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.900
Because he knows that's 
the fastest way to heal.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.390
Don't let them get away! After them!

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.200
Attack their password list.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.080
Log in.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.080
There's another squad coming from the south!

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:39.970
I thought you couldn't use the internet?

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.750
I hacked into the army's network.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.770
It was old, and full of holes.

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.710
Nicely done, partner.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.230
Grab a grenade from the bag.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:02.830
This thing?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.040
You throw it.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.010
I've never thrown one before!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.260
That's no reason not to do so now!

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:16.630
Pull the pin...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.850
...and throw!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.380
Thank you, Amy.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:41.910
You just saved Lupin and me. 
As well as yourself, of course.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.900
Hold on tight!

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:04.440
Infantry, after them!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:06.550
I want a perimeter of vehicles
 around the forest!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:17.130
Looks like we've reached the end of the line.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.480
What now?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.220
We do this.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.390
Don't tell me...

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.110
You're going to run off without us?!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.880
I'll give you a piece of advice, kid.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:46.840
If you want to live, find a bush to 
hide in and don't move a muscle.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:50.120
After all, that's about all you 
two can manage right now!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:52.150
Fujiko Mine...

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.350
I was almost starting to respect you!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.940
But you're as despicable as I thought!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:16:00.140
You dump Lupin, you abandon us...

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.150
How can you be so selfish?!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.050
It's like I told you...

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.660
I'm a woman who's always 
loyal to her desires.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.970
You witch!

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.900
Go die, you callous tramp!

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.630
Damn you, Lupin. You won't 
get the better of me this time!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.950
I've located the Bloody Teardrop!

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.430
They're heading northwest with it!

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:44.790
I'm not going to let it end like this...

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:48.280
I... I have to save Lupin and...

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.560
No!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.600
I've got him! I've found Lupin!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.770
I've got you now, you shrew.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.710
Hey, Captain!

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.930
How about we do a trade?

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.680
Do you think you're in 
any position to negotiate?!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.680
Don't you want the necklace 
back in one piece?

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.220
Plus, I have a juicy bit of intel 
you're just gonna <i>love</i>...

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.970
How about the two of us talk it over?

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.700
Go.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.240
Me, sir?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.520
That's an order!

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:17.650
Yes, sir.

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.920
Start shooting as soon as the door opens.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.240
Are you sure, sir?

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:33.050
The only order I received was 
to retrieve the Bloody Teardrop.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:35.220
That's all that matters.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:43.670
The king's forces have 
begun their counterattack!

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:45.070
What did you say?!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.840
They've already wrested back 
control of the TV station.

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:50.760
His Majesty has started broadcasting 
an address to the nation.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.620
No way...

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:54.500
The king's alive?

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.770
That wasn't the plan...

00:18:56.170 --> 00:19:00.420
We've still got control of 
every road in the capital.

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.000
Was there a traitor in our camp?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.280
Look, sir! The airship!

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:09.130
It's coming this way!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.280
Is it crashing?!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:15.460
R-Retreat! Everyone, retreat!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.820
But the necklace...

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.930
Now's not the time!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:20.980
Wait for me!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:21.750
Run for it!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.690
It's coming right for us!

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:32.550
Hey! We're moving out!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:35.270
Could it be...

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.040
Lupin III!

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:41.860
Fujiko!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.970
Lupin?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.020
Fujiko!

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.500
That idiot. The first thing 
he tries to do is running?!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.850
It sure <i>looks</i> like you love her.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.590
You're not getting away this time, Lupin!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.100
Stay back!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.600
Just tell me, Lupin.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.360
What am I to you, anyway?

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.130
Damned Lupin!

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.740
Fujiko... You're my...

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:18.390
Daisuke Jigen here.

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:22.310
C'mon, Lupin. There's a damned war going on.

00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:25.430
An entire country's about 
to get turned on its head.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:29.020
And this sham coronation's 
gonna happen any time now.

00:22:29.940 --> 00:22:33.490
Come on out. We've got 
the loot in our sights.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:37.660
How are you planning on dealing 
with this coup d'état, anyway?

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:40.750
Next time: Let's Talk About First Loves.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.910
<b>Let's Talk About First Loves</b>

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:43.810
Love? You gotta be kidding me...
